      interactionFlow: "The user invokes Doubao through voice or an orange AI button and states an outcome, such as finding videos on Douyin, searching flights on Qunar, ordering from Luckin, or comparing services. In 36Kr's hands-on, the phone opens the relevant app, shows execution steps, reasoning, and progress, and asks the user to tap a task-verification button when needed. Several tasks can be submitted together and unprocessed work enters a queue. The interactive pages were not public before launch, so the final flow must be checked on retail hardware.",
      specsOrStack: "Public coverage confirms or mentions the Doubao mobile assistant, Doubao Phone Assistant Intent Model 2.0, system-level app invocation, task queues, active memory, and ChangXin LPDDR5X at 10,667 Mbps; TechNode also names Qualcomm, BOE, Samsung Semiconductor, and Goodix as partners. Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5, a 7,000mAh battery, detailed cameras, display, memory capacity, and local/cloud division are reported or unconfirmed and must not be treated as final nubia specifications. API, permissions, app coverage, payment confirmation, and enterprise management are source not stated.",
